1970   CALL MKLEAVES(310,5,6)
1980   CALL MKSKY
1990   CALL MKBARK
2000   CALL W3K_WINDOW(313)
2010   CALL MKSOIL
2020   CALL MKWHEATTOP
2030   CALL MKLEAVES(317,4,3)
2040   CALL W3K_CARPET(323,1)
